@startuml deployment_production_diagram
title Design Pattern Playground - Production deployment

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

cloud "Internet" as Internet
node "DNS" as DNS

node "VPS\nLinux + Docker + Compose" as VPS {
  node "Docker network\ntraefik-public" as TraefikNet {
    node "Traefik\nreverse proxy + TLS" as Traefik

    node "Registry stack" as RegistryStack {
      node "Docker Registry\nregistry:2" as Registry
      file "htpasswd" as Htpasswd
      folder "registry_data" as RegistryData
    }

    node "Application stack\ncompose.prod.yml" as AppStack {
      node "Frontend container\nNginx static app" as Frontend
      node "Backend container\nSpring Boot API" as Backend
      database "PostgreSQL 16" as Postgres
      folder "postgres_data" as PostgresData
    }
  }
}

Internet --> DNS
DNS --> Traefik : APP_HOST\nREGISTRY_HOST

Traefik --> Frontend : Host(APP_HOST)\nPath /
Traefik --> Backend : Host(APP_HOST)\nPath /api
Traefik --> Registry : Host(REGISTRY_HOST)

Frontend --> Backend : HTTP /api\nsame origin via Traefik
Backend --> Postgres : JDBC
Postgres --> PostgresData

Registry --> Htpasswd
Registry --> RegistryData

note right of Frontend
Image tiree depuis la registry privee :
${REGISTRY_HOST}/${REGISTRY_NAMESPACE}/frontend:${APP_IMAGE_TAG}
end note

note right of Backend
Image tiree depuis la registry privee :
${REGISTRY_HOST}/${REGISTRY_NAMESPACE}/backend:${APP_IMAGE_TAG}
end note

note bottom of Traefik
Traefik publie :
- frontend sur /
- backend sur /api
- registry sur REGISTRY_HOST
end note

note bottom of Backend
Auth via cookies HttpOnly.
Le frontend ne stocke pas les tokens d acces.
end note

@enduml
